###1. GET all devices
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

###2. GET one device
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices/2
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

###3. CREATE one device
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "switch-04",
  "type": "switch",
  "owner": "it-department"
}

###4. UPDATE one device
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices/2
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "printer-02-renamed",
  "type": "printer",
  "owner": "security"
}

###5. DELETE one device
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices/3
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json
